\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Clarity Caddy Membership Cancellation Policy\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Monthly Membership\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Clarity Caddy Membership is offered at a discounted monthly rate in return for a 12-month commitment.\
Members can cancel their Membership at any time. Cancellation does not require the member to pay for the remaining unused months of the 12-month term.\
If a Membership is cancelled before the end of the 12-month commitment, the discount received during the Membership is removed.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Early Cancellation \'97 Discount Adjustment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 When cancelling early, each completed or paid Membership month is recalculated at the standard 
\f0\b Month Pass price
\f1\b0  that applied during that period.\
The member is charged only the difference between:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 The amount already paid for Membership
\f1\b0 \
and\

\f0\b What the same period would have cost using Month Passes.
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 When Access Ends\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 After cancellation, Membership access continues until the end of the member's current paid period.\
The Membership will not renew after that date.\
Any applicable early-cancellation discount adjustment is charged when the cancellation is processed.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 After Completing the 12-Month Commitment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Once the initial 12-month commitment has been completed, no discount adjustment applies.\
The Membership can then be cancelled without an early-cancellation charge, with access continuing until the end of the current paid period.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Principle\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The early-cancellation adjustment is not intended to charge members for access they will not receive.\
The discounted Membership price is provided in return for completing the agreed commitment. If a member chooses to leave early, the time already used is simply returned to the standard Month Pass rate.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Members never pay for the unused remainder of their commitment.
\f1\b0 \
